              "excerpt": "3.5 L V6 (2GR-FKS) engine. Use Toyota approved Toyota Genuine Motor Oil or equivalent to satisfy the following grade and viscosity. Oil grade: ILSAC GF-5 multigrade engine oil. Recommended viscosity: SAE 0W-20.",
