              "excerpt": "Lubrication system (2.0 L 4-cylinder [M20A-FKS] engine). Use Toyota approved Toyota Genuine Motor Oil or equivalent to satisfy the following grade and viscosity. Oil grade: API SN/RC multigrade engine oil. Recommended viscosity: SAE 0W-16.",
