              "excerpt": "[PDF 681, Engine table] Engine Model: 2.5 L 4-cylinder (A25A-FXS). [PDF 682–683, common Lubrication system and Engine oil selection] If SAE 0W-16 is not available, SAE 0W-20 oil may be used. However, it must be replaced with SAE 0W-16 at the next oil change.",
