          "evidenceNotes": "Reused cached official Canadian PDF; cover and colophon establish MY2020 and publication. The Canadian catalogue binds this exact manual. All-model coverage is on PDF 10. Exact identity is on PDF 538; relevant oil section on PDF 539, 540. Excerpts preserve section/row context: an engine heading and its shared selection text may be non-contiguous on the cited page(s), not a fabricated single row. Only the common oil-selection rule is published for the Canadian V6 application. Package-dependent quantity evidence and its numerical claims are deliberately absent from this record and public locators. The other engine is not included.",
          "locators": [
            {
              "id": "publication",
              "pageNumbers": [
                1,
                612
              ],
              "fields": [
                "application"
              ],
              "excerpt": "TACOMA 2020 OWNER’S MANUAL. Publication No.OM04025U. Part No.01999-04025. Printed 01-1908-00."
            },
            {
              "id": "all-models",
              "pageNumbers": [
                10
              ],
              "fields": [
                "application"
              ],
              "excerpt": "Please note that this manual applies to all models and all equipment, including options. Therefore, you may find some explanations for equipment not installed on your vehicle."
            },
            {
              "id": "engine",
              "pageNumbers": [
                538
              ],
              "fields": [
                "application",
                "engineIdentity.engineeringCode"
              ],
              "excerpt": "Engine Model: 2GR-FKS. Type: 6-cylinder V type, 4-cycle, gasoline.",
              "engineCodes": [
                "2GR-FKS"
              ],
              "applicabilityRef": {
                "sourceId": "toyota-ca-om04025u",
                "locatorId": "all-models"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "selection",
              "pageNumbers": [
                539
              ],
              "fields": [
                "allowedSaeViscosities",
                "industrySpecifications",
                "oilRequirements"
              ],
              "excerpt": "2GR-FKS engine [engine row heading in the Lubrication system table]. Use Toyota approved Toyota Genuine Motor Oil or equivalent to satisfy the following grade and viscosity. Oil grade: ILSAC GF-5 multigrade engine oil. Recommended viscosity: SAE 0W-20.",
              "engineCodes": [
                "2GR-FKS"
              ],
              "applicabilityRef": {
                "sourceId": "toyota-ca-om04025u",
                "locatorId": "all-models"
              },
              "relation": "allOf"
            },
            {
              "id": "preferred",
              "pageNumbers": [
                539,
                540
              ],
              "fields": [
                "oilRequirements"
              ],
              "excerpt": "2GR-FKS engine [engine row heading in the Lubrication system table]. SAE 0W-20 is the best choice for good fuel economy and good starting in cold weather. An oil with a higher viscosity may be better suited if the vehicle is operated at high speeds, or under extreme load conditions.",
              "engineCodes": [
                "2GR-FKS"
              ],
              "applicabilityRef": {
                "sourceId": "toyota-ca-om04025u",
                "locatorId": "all-models"
              },
              "condition": {
                "en": "Recommended SAE 0W-20. At high speeds or under extreme load, a higher viscosity may be better suited; the manual does not name another permanent SAE here.",
                "es": "SAE 0W-20 recomendado. A alta velocidad o con carga extrema, una mayor viscosidad puede ser más adecuada; el manual no indica aquí otro SAE permanente.",
                "fr": "SAE 0W-20 recommandée. À grande vitesse ou sous charge extrême, une viscosité supérieure peut mieux convenir ; aucun autre SAE permanent n’est nommé ici.",
                "de": "SAE 0W-20 empfohlen. Bei hoher Geschwindigkeit oder extremer Last kann eine höhere Viskosität geeigneter sein; eine weitere dauerhafte SAE-Klasse wird hier nicht genannt."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "temporary",
              "pageNumbers": [
                539,
                540
              ],
              "fields": [
                "allowedSaeViscosities",
                "oilRequirements"
              ],
              "excerpt": "2GR-FKS engine [engine row heading in the Lubrication system table]. If SAE 0W-20 is not available, SAE 5W-20 oil may be used. However, it must be replaced with SAE 0W-20 at the next oil change.",
              "engineCodes": [
                "2GR-FKS"
              ],
              "applicabilityRef": {
                "sourceId": "toyota-ca-om04025u",
                "locatorId": "all-models"
              },
              "relation": "anyOf",
              "temporarySubstitution": {
                "preferredIndex": 0,
                "temporaryIndex": 1
              },
              "condition": {
                "en": "If SAE 0W-20 is not available, SAE 5W-20 may be used. It must be replaced with SAE 0W-20 at the next oil change.",
                "es": "Si SAE 0W-20 no está disponible, puede usarse SAE 5W-20. Debe sustituirse por SAE 0W-20 en el siguiente cambio de aceite.",
                "fr": "Si SAE 0W-20 est indisponible, SAE 5W-20 peut être utilisée. Elle doit être remplacée par SAE 0W-20 à la prochaine vidange.",
                "de": "Wenn SAE 0W-20 nicht verfügbar ist, darf SAE 5W-20 verwendet werden. Beim nächsten Ölwechsel muss wieder SAE 0W-20 eingefüllt werden."
              }
            }
          ]
