              "excerpt": "[PDF 656 / printed 654, Engine table] Model: 1.8 L 4-cylinder (2ZR-FXE). [PDF 658 / printed 656, common Lubrication system / Engine oil selection] Use Toyota approved Toyota Genuine Motor Oil or equivalent to satisfy the following grade and viscosity. Oil grade: API SN/RC multigrade engine oil. Recommended viscosity: SAE 0W-16.",
